{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minesweeper, Reimagined\uff01 Experience original Big Bomb Mode + classic minesweeper gameplay, offering dual logic deduction experiences! Enjoy quirky power-ups and collect various skins/achievements! Try it now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/Frame_2072.jpg?t=1746585806\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to learn, multiple modes, achievement collection \u2013 a brand-new minesweeper with endless challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two distinct gameplay styles, each with dozens of difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Innovative Big Bomb Mode: Reverse logic \u2013 detonate all mines this time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse power-ups: New players can use items to conquer challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable skins: Collect and mix mine markers, flags, tiles and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced trials: Complete badge challenges like no-retry runs, item-free clears, blind sweeps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn coins by clearing stages to buy skins or revive in-game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extreme challenges, historical records, personal achievements await!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3707010?t=1746585806","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/bcb596f77c4f89ecc60213d959d5c193af0f3df9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746585806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/ccc9afbcbccb423ae60c55eb6a1406cae6ac79d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746585806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/ccc9afbcbccb423ae60c55eb6a1406cae6ac79d7/capsu